er employee (modest relative to workforce productivity).","financial_summary":["HIVE Digital Technologies Ltd is a small-cap financial services business with a $488M market cap on $298M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +158% over the past three years, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at -16% against a 12% cost of capital, which means the business is destroying value with every dollar it reinvests, and -28% gross margins are typical of commodity economics where competitors can replicate the product cheaply.","The business throws off $41M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 14 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders.","Accruals are elevated at -33.0% of assets, and Sloan showed firms building earnings through accruals rather than cash systematically underperform.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year.","Net dilution runs at 40.2% annually, transferring value from owners to stock-based comp, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"ROIC sits in the bottom decile among Financial Services peers \u2014 no moat advantage to speak of","sev":"red","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Carries a 60% premium to sector median EV/EBITDA (confirmed by 1 other valuation measure)","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.6022456941669045},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the grey zone \u2014 financial health warrants monitoring","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Insiders are overwhelmingly selling (100% sell ratio) \u2014 the people who know the business want less of it","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","ratio":0.0},{"text":"Gross margin trails most Finan